/*
  GeneralSettings.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0207 · GeneralSettings (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table "GeneralSettings").
  Every user-facing string the SwiftUI parity of
  features/settings/components/GeneralSettings.tsx renders resolves here through
  the GeneralSettingsStrings facade with the web `t(key, default)` English value
  as the fallback. Native-only additions (the ADR-013 freshness chip + offline
  band, the empty / error states, and the draft-recovery banner copy) are grouped
  at the bottom. Folds into the app Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at
  integration time; kept per-surface so this prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.
*/

